smithy auth set: subcommand of smithy auth

usage: smithy auth set <service> < keyfile | list | remove <service>
       smithy auth bind <service> <host> [METHODS] [--header <name>]
           [--prefix <scheme>] | ask <service> on|off

Examples:
  smithy auth set linear < key.txt

See also: smithy help auth, smithy help pool, smithy help config
Exit codes: 0 success, 1 failure, 2 usage error (3 where a command's help says).
